#version 450
// Optimum ambient occlusion, pass 3 of 3: the edge-aware 3x3 denoise
// (docs/vulkan.md#ambient-occlusion C.8).
//
// One pass with TAA; the final pass scales the term back from the 1.5 packing.
// Ported from XeGTAO's XeGTAO_Denoise (centre weight DenoiseBlurBeta on the final pass
// and beta / 5 before it, symmetric 2-bit edges, diagonal weights and the leak term):
//
//   Copyright (C) 2016-2021, Intel Corporation
